    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7907,
      "back_translation": "种树不只是为了让城市变美，对生态保护也非常重要。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9796,
      "back_translation": "树可以净化空气、减少噪音，还能帮助小动物和小鸟找到家。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9778,
      "back_translation": "一位老师说：“我们种的不只是树，而是在恢复生物多样性。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9091,
      "back_translation": "”她的意思是，不同种类的植物和动物能够一起生活，自然才会健康。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9,
      "back_translation": "这个项目叫“绿色家园”，是本地行动的一个好例子。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7907,
      "back_translation": "它从一小块空地开始，现在已经扩大到五个居民区。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9091,
      "back_translation": "每一个参加的人都是社区建设的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.625,
      "back_translation": "虽然城市发展得很快，我们也可以为保护环境做一些事。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9455,
      "back_translation": "一位老人说：“我小时候这里有很多树，现在我们把绿色还给城市。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.92,
      "back_translation": "”年轻人和孩子们也加入了，他们学习自然知识，也学会了合作。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
